{{also|lif|Líf|LiF}}
==Icelandic==

===Etymology===
From {{der|is|non|líf}}, from {{der|is|gem-pro|*lībą}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|is|/liːv/}}
*: {{rhymes|is|iːv|s=1}}

===Noun===
{{is-noun|@@}}

# {{lb|is|uncountable}} [[life]] {{gloss|the state of being alive}}
#* ''Article 1'', [[Universal Declaration of Human Rights]] ([http://www.ohchr.org/EN/UDHR/Pages/Language.aspx?LangID=ice Icelandic], [http://www.ohchr.org/EN/UDHR/Pages/Language.aspx?LangID=eng English])
#*: ''Allir menn eiga rétt til '''lífs''', frelsis og mannhelgi.''
#*:: Everyone has the right to '''life''', liberty and security of person.
# {{lb|is|uncountable}} life {{gloss|the period during which an individual is alive}}
# {{lb|is|usually|uncountable}} an individual’s way of living or experience of being alive (throughout one’s lifespan or in some period of it); life, [[lifestyle]]
#* {{quote-web|is|
author=Fjölnir Ásbjörnsson|site=tru.is|url=http://tru.is/postilla/2011/06/að-snua-ser-til-guðs|format=sermon|month=June|year=2011|passage=Hvað hefur græðgin eyðilagt margar sálir og mörg líf?|translation=How many '''lives''' has greed destroyed?}}
# {{lb|is|uncountable}} life {{gloss|living things collectively}}
# {{lb|is|by extension}} life {{gloss|the existence of an inanimate object as a functional or distinct entity}}
# {{lb|is|countable|video games}} [[life]] {{gloss|one of the player’s chances to play, lost when a mistake is made}}
#: {{usex|is|Ég átti bara eitt '''líf''' eftir þegar ég komst loksins í síðasta borðið.|I only had one '''life''' left when I finally got to the last level.}}
# {{lb|is|uncountable|video games}} [[health]], [[hit point]]s, the amount of damage a player can take before he loses a life
#* {{quote-web|is|
author=kjarni|site=hugi.is|url=https://www.hugi.is/blizzard/greinar/4625/rush/#21976|format=forum|month=September|year=2000|section=comments|passage=Terran eru bestir í að survivea 6pool vegna scvs sem eru með 60 í '''líf'''..|translation=[[w:Races_of_StarCraft#Terrans|Terran]] are best at surviving a 6pool because of SCVs who have 60 '''HP''' [lit. 60 in health/HP].}}
#* {{quote-web|is|
author=kjellz|site=hugi.is|url=https://www.hugi.is/blizzard/korkar/380449/warsong-gulch/#3140277|format=forum|month=February|year=2006|section=comments|passage=og já feral druidar í PvP setti eru oftast með MIKLU meira '''líf''' en warrior í Tier 1 epici|translation=and yes, feral druids in [i.e. wearing/wielding] a [[PvP]] [[set]] [i.e. item set] most often have MUCH more '''health''' than a warrior in Tier 1 epic [i.e. a Tier 1 item set of epic quality]}}

